malicious_snippets.code_snippet:
The vulnerable code in commons-compress 1.6 fails to sanitize file paths when extracting entries from ZIP archives. As a result, entries containing '../' sequences are written outside the intended extraction directory, enabling directory traversal attacks. For example:

if (!entry.isDirectory()) {
    File outFile = new File(outputDir, entry.getName());
    // No check for path traversal
    FileOutputStream fos = new FileOutputStream(outFile);
    // ... write file contents ...
    fos.close();
}
// This allows extraction of files to arbitrary locations if entry.getName() contains '../'
